nou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nI made some suggestions as for renaming the setting to be more intuitive. I think the default value is good to encourage UID usage.\r\n\r\nNote that relative paths are valid in `load()` and `preload()`, but handling these is a lot more complex as you'd need to be aware of the current script path (the script must also be saved to disk). This PR doesn't show a file picker for them, but it still works correctly otherwise.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110920#pullrequestreview-3276903334","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110920","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-09-28T14:53:36Z"},{"id":3281086524,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7DkWg8","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"When the the path is long enough to go off of the screen and word wrap is off, the inlay path doesn't draw correctly, it gets clipped. It happens if you scroll to far horizontally too.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110920#pullrequestreview-3281086524","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110920","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-09-29T19:44:11Z"},{"id":3281811759,"node_id":"PRR_kwDO